      "writtenOn": "2024-08-06T23:21:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changing the following line to 0x1000, allows for making the code ram size to 160KiB.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/chip/npcx/config_flash_layout.h;l\u003d110;drc\u003d29c7712541e8f85c53bac4d23147604585a764d8",
      "parentUuid": "89725ad2_894d03d7",
      "range": {
