      "writtenOn": "2024-08-06T23:27:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The 64KiB incorrectly forced alignment in http://b/357938320 seems to explain the odd behavior of why I needed such a high value of 192KiB here, when we were really using much less code ram.\n\nThis change is quite moderate, compared to how little code ram we actually need. 320 is also a multiple of 64KiB (and 32KiB and 4KiB), so all other code should be happy. I\u0027m happy with submitting this.",
